# HMI

This folder contains the Human-Machine Interface (HMI) development for the Mini Automated Sorting Conveyor.

## Current Status

Planned

HMI development will begin after the basic PLC control sequence has been implemented.

## Planned Functions

The HMI will eventually provide:

- System Start and Stop controls
- Automatic and Manual mode selection
- Conveyor status
- Sensor status
- Actuator status
- Production counter
- Alarm display
- Fault acknowledgement and reset
- Manual actuator controls
- System operating status

## Planned Screens

Potential HMI screens include:

1. Main Overview
2. Manual Control
3. Alarm and Fault History
4. System Status
5. Production Information

Screenshots and HMI project files will be added during development.
